# Ember Etching — Lantern loading concept C

A text-free 2D gothic reliquary, circled by distressed thorn engraving. Fire brings the image out of soot; the hold remains quietly alive with bending painted flame, glancing warmth through metal incisions, drifting smoke and sparse ascending cinders. On completion, the light gathers briefly and extinguishes into black.

