- `03_ember_etching_preview.mp4`: 8 seconds; intro + one hold cycle + completion.
- `03_ember_etching_intro.mp4`: 2 seconds / 120 frames. Black to fully revealed hold.
- `03_ember_etching_hold_loop.mp4`: 4 seconds / 240 frames. Seamless indefinite hold.
- `03_ember_etching_complete.mp4`: 2 seconds / 120 frames. Matching hold state to black.
